criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Adults (over 18y.o.) undergoing elective intermediate - high risk noncardiac surgery:

  * hepatobiliary - liver resection, whipple resection, esophagectomy;
  * general surgery - bowel resection, ventral hernia repair, adrenal, spleen, gastric;
  * uro-gynaecology - hysterectomy/oophorectomy, radical cystectomy, nephrectomy;
  * vascular - thoracic or abdominal aortic aneurysm repair, carotid endarterectomy, lower limb revascularization;
  * orthopaedics/spine - major joint replacement, long-bone, pelvis, shoulder, spine;
  * neurosurgery - craniotomy; ENT - major cancer resection;
  * Thoracic - lung resection.
* A working knowledge of English or translational support available within the time frame of study recruitment.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Lack of informed consent
* Unable to complete assessments and/or no caregiver/next of kin available to support these assessments
* Advanced dementia
